QUALIFICATIONS:

&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;• A bachelor’s degree from an accredited school.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;• Advanced level skills with MS Office applications (Word, Excel, Share Point) and Worktext Markup.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;• Must have 4 to 8 years of experience in documentation creation and curation.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

